{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【璀璨之城】第五集精華 主席爭奪戰再啟動 官家媳婦為選票比鬥！</p><p></p><p>官志琛為咗公平競爭，公開表明成功將十月初五街活化計劃落實嘅人，就會得到佢嘅關鍵一票！而爭奪授權書嘅重任，就落喺官家兩個媳婦身上！</p><p></p><p>璀璨之城｜星期一至五 晚上08:30 PM｜翡翠台</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:20:30.275363+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T19:58:34.276458+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:42.844747+00:00","content_hash":"9d008d015a7622edc1a2a22d768be14e4cb2f6056632f26b90eac90278eaca2d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}